00:36:59.230 --> 00:37:06.119
Well, the first thing to say is is the C.
difficile infection are very specific diseases.

00:37:06.119 --> 00:37:07.930
We know what causes it.

00:37:07.930 --> 00:37:09.470
It's acute and onset.

00:37:09.470 --> 00:37:16.480
The treatment is is really it has now become
