00:37:40.370 --> 00:37:45.400
one approach to the other, and gradually we've
ramped up our approaches to these diseases

00:37:45.400 --> 00:37:48.150
and that's what has to be done in the microbiome
field too.

00:37:48.150 --> 00:37:52.040
They, they are trying it with certain diseases,
