00:37:52.040 --> 00:37:53.560
What is the status of that?

00:37:53.560 --> 00:37:55.119
That work?

00:37:55.119 --> 00:38:01.720
Lots of ongoing trials now for everything
from Crohn's disease, ulcerative colitis to

00:38:01.720 --> 00:38:05.460
obesity and any of these conditions that we've
been talking about.

00:38:05.460 --> 00:38:06.770
There are trials underway.

00:38:06.770 --> 00:38:12.830
I think my own view is that it's going to
be a bit tougher and less likely to work easily

00:38:12.830 --> 00:38:15.230
for the reason that Marty suggested.

00:38:15.230 --> 00:38:20.690
We don't know the the instigating cause or
something that is easy enough to knock down

00:38:20.690 --> 00:38:26.580
temporarily the way we can knock down C. difficile
temporarily in order to open up that niche

00:38:26.580 --> 00:38:28.570
space for the new community.

00:38:28.570 --> 00:38:33.680
A lot of these diseases as like the health
