00:39:07.831 --> 00:39:08.831
They just get better.

00:39:08.831 --> 00:39:13.050
They go out of the hospital after 48 hours
and they're done, and so we don't have a good

00:39:13.050 --> 00:39:17.780
enough understanding of why it works, even
in the most extreme case that we, we can't

00:39:17.780 --> 00:39:22.080
really transfer that knowledge to the all
the other much more complicated conditions

00:39:22.080 --> 00:39:23.080
that you're talking about.

00:39:23.080 --> 00:39:29.000
Well it's important to point out that C. diff
is a disease that is acquired by physicians

00:39:29.000 --> 00:39:34.770
who give patients lots and lots of antibiotic,
