diff takes over.

00:39:35.770 --> 00:39:38.320
I mean, so they're very different than some
of these chronic diseases.

00:39:38.320 --> 00:39:40.980
It can happen even with one course of antibiotics.

00:39:40.980 --> 00:39:42.270
It can happen even with one.

